@*
    ── תוכנית המחזור (Admin Cycle Detail) ───────────────────────────────────
    Route:  /management/cycles/{CycleId}
            Reached from the cycle name or the row menu on /management/cycles.

    Visual source:
        design/design-system/Motiva Admin Cycle Detail.dc.html

    WHAT WAS TAKEN FROM THE REFERENCE, AND WHAT WAS NOT
    ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
    Taken: the composition (breadcrumb → title + state pill + meta line +
    edit action / a section head carrying the program's own actions / one
    full-width table of compact rows), the "#" order disc, the type chip with
    its dot, the dot-and-text status, the up/down order controls, the row
    kebab, and both modals.

    NOT taken: the prototype's outer shell — its logo, top nav, profile
    cluster, page background and rounded frame. Admin already resolves to the
    canvas shell in AppLayout, so this page renders CONTENT ONLY.

    NOT taken either: every milestone, date, count and cycle name in the
    prototype. All of it is mock. Everything below is
    AcademicYearMilestones ⋈ MilestoneTemplates for THIS cycle.

    WHERE THE REAL MODEL DIFFERS FROM THE PROTOTYPE
    ───────────────────────────────────────────────
    • TWO TABLES, ONE ROW. Title / description / project-type / required live
      on the SHARED MilestoneTemplate; dates / active / order live on this
      cycle's AcademicYearMilestones row. The edit modal writes both and warns
      when the template is shared with another cycle — see the modal's note.
    • ORDER. The prototype reorders a local array. Here the arrows PATCH
      AcademicYearMilestones.DisplayOrder, a column added for this screen
      because the only order that existed before was the template's global
      OrderIndex — which would have moved the milestone in every other cycle
      too. The modal shows the position read-only: the arrows own it, and two
      editors for one value only drift apart.
    • A "פרויקטים" COLUMN THE PROTOTYPE DOES NOT DRAW. Real cycles mix
      curriculum milestones held by every project with milestones that exist
      for a single team, and the prototype's columns give no way to tell them
      apart. It is also the number that decides whether removal is safe.
    • "מבוסס על תבנית" IS ABSENT. In this product EVERY cycle milestone is
      based on a template — the chip would be true on all rows and mean
      nothing. What the row says instead, when it is true, is that the
      template is shared with other cycles.
    • DELETE IS GUARDED, NOT FREE. The server refuses to remove a milestone
      that projects already hold, and the dialog says so before asking.

    TWO DIFFERENT "APPLY TEMPLATES", BOTH REAL, BOTH IN THIS MENU
    ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
      • החלת תבניות             library templates → THIS cycle's program
                                (POST .../program/apply-templates)
      • החלה על פרויקטי המחזור   this program → ProjectMilestones + Tasks
                                (POST .../apply-templates — pre-existing, and
                                previously the list page's per-row button)
    The reference places the first in this menu. The second is the existing
    rollout and keeps its own confirmation, because it writes to every active
    project in the cycle.
*@

@page "/management/cycles/{CycleId:int}"
@layout AppLayout
@attribute [Authorize(Roles = Roles.Admin)]
@using AuthWithAdmin.Client.Services
@using AuthWithAdmin.Shared.AuthSharedModels
@inject NavigationManager Nav
@inject IManagementService ManagementService

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     ADD / EDIT MILESTONE MODAL
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ *@
@if (_msOpen)
{
    <div class="cd-modal-overlay" @onclick="CloseMilestoneModal">
        <div class="cd-modal-box cd-modal-box--lg" @onclick:stopPropagation="true" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">

            <div class="cd-modal-header">
                <span class="cd-modal-glyph" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <div class="cd-modal-titles">
                    <div class="cd-modal-title">@(_msEditId == 0 ? "אבן דרך חדשה" : "עריכת אבן דרך")</div>
                    <div class="cd-modal-subtitle">אבן דרך במחזור @(_cycle?.Name ?? "")</div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="cd-modal-close" @onclick="CloseMilestoneModal" aria-label="סגירה">
                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="cd-modal-body">

                <p class="cd-form-section">פרטים בסיסיים</p>

                <div class="cd-form-grid cd-form-grid--name">
                    <div class="cd-form-field">
                        <label class="cd-form-label" for="cd-ms-name">שם אבן הדרך <span class="cd-req">*</span></label>
                        <input id="cd-ms-name" class="cd-form-input" @bind="_msName"
                               placeholder="לדוגמה: אפיון ועיצוב" maxlength="120" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="cd-form-field">
                        <label class="cd-form-label" for="cd-ms-order">מספר סדר</label>
                        <div id="cd-ms-order" class="cd-form-readonly" title="הסדר נקבע בחצי הסידור בטבלה">
                            @(_msEditId == 0 ? (_program.Count + 1).ToString("00") : _msOrderLabel)
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="cd-form-field">
                    <label class="cd-form-label" for="cd-ms-desc">תיאור</label>
                    <textarea id="cd-ms-desc" class="cd-form-textarea" @bind="_msDescription"
                              placeholder="תיאור קצר של אבן הדרך ומטרתה" rows="3"></textarea>
                </div>

                <p class="cd-form-section">רלוונטיות</p>
                <span class="cd-form-label">רלוונטי לסוג פרויקט</span>

                @* Three real values, exactly what MilestoneTemplates.ProjectTypeId
                   stores: NULL = both, 1 = Technological, 2 = Methodological. *@
                <div class="cd-choice-grid">
                    @foreach (var choice in TypeChoices)
                    {
                        var val = choice.Value;
                        var on  = _msProjectTypeId == val;
                        <button type="button"
                                class="cd-choice @(on ? "cd-choice--on" : "")"
                                @onclick="@(() => _msProjectTypeId = val)"
                                aria-pressed="@(on ? "true" : "false")">
                            <span class="cd-choice-dot cd-choice-dot--@choice.Tone" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            <span class="cd-choice-label">@choice.Label</span>
                        </button>
                    }
                </div>

                <p class="cd-form-section">הגדרות</p>

                <div class="cd-form-grid">
                    <div class="cd-switch-row">
                        <div class="cd-switch-copy">
                            <span class="cd-switch-title">חובה</span>
                            <span class="cd-switch-note">נדרשת בכל פרויקט רלוונטי במחזור</span>
                        </div>
                        <MToggle Checked="_msRequired"
                                 CheckedChanged="@(v => _msRequired = v)"
                                 AriaLabel="אבן דרך חובה" />
                    </div>

                    <div class="cd-switch-row">
                        <div class="cd-switch-copy">
                            <span class="cd-switch-title">פעיל</span>
                            <span class="cd-switch-note">מוצג בציר ההתקדמות של הפרויקטים</span>
                        </div>
                        <MToggle Checked="_msActive"
                                 CheckedChanged="@(v => _msActive = v)"
                                 AriaLabel="אבן דרך פעילה" />
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="cd-form-section">
                    תאריכים במחזור <span class="cd-form-section-note">(רשות)</span>
                </p>

                <div class="cd-form-grid">
                    <div class="cd-form-field">
                        <label class="cd-form-label" for="cd-ms-start">תאריך התחלה</label>
                        <input id="cd-ms-start" type="date" class="cd-form-input"
                               @bind="_msOpenDate" @bind:format="yyyy-MM-dd" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="cd-form-field">
                        <label class="cd-form-label" for="cd-ms-due">תאריך יעד</label>
                        <input id="cd-ms-due" type="date" class="cd-form-input"
                               @bind="_msDueDate" @bind:format="yyyy-MM-dd" />
                    </div>
                </div>

                @* AcademicYearMilestones.DueDate is NOT NULL. Rather than
                   reject an empty due date the server falls back to the
                   cycle's end date, so the admin is told what will be saved
                   instead of finding out afterwards. *@
                @if (_msDueDate is null && _cycle is not null)
                {
                    <div class="cd-form-note">
                        ללא תאריך יעד — אבן הדרך תקבל את תאריך סיום המחזור
                        (@_cycle.EndDate.ToString("dd.MM.yyyy")).
                    </div>
                }

                @* The one thing this screen must never do silently: rename a
                   template that another cycle is also using. *@
                @if (_msSharedCycles > 1)
                {
                    <div class="cd-form-warn">
                        התבנית של אבן דרך זו משמשת @_msSharedCycles מחזורים.
                        שינוי השם, התיאור, סוג הפרויקט או סימון החובה ישפיע על כולם —
                        התאריכים והסטטוס נשמרים למחזור זה בלבד.
                    </div>
                }

                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_msError))
                {
                    <div class="cd-form-error" role="alert">@_msError</div>
                }
            </div>

            <div class="cd-modal-footer">
                <span class="cd-footer-note">שדות המסומנים ב־<span class="cd-req">*</span> הם חובה</span>
                <div class="cd-footer-actions">
                    <button type="button" class="cd-btn-ghost" @onclick="CloseMilestoneModal" disabled="@_msSaving">ביטול</button>
                    <button type="button" class="cd-btn-primary motiva-cta" @onclick="SaveMilestone" disabled="@_msSaving">
                        @if (_msSaving) { <span class="cd-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span> }
                        שמירה
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     EDIT CYCLE MODAL
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ *@
@if (_cyOpen && _cycle is not null)
{
    <div class="cd-modal-overlay" @onclick="CloseCycleModal">
        <div class="cd-modal-box" @onclick:stopPropagation="true" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
            <div class="cd-modal-header">
                <span class="cd-modal-glyph" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" />
                        <path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <div class="cd-modal-titles">
                    <div class="cd-modal-title">עריכת מחזור</div>
                    <div class="cd-modal-subtitle">מחזור @_cycle.Name</div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="cd-modal-close" @onclick="CloseCycleModal" aria-label="סגירה">
                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="cd-modal-body">
                <div class="cd-form-field">
                    <label class="cd-form-label" for="cd-cy-name">שם מחזור <span class="cd-req">*</span></label>
                    <input id="cd-cy-name" class="cd-form-input" @bind="_cyName" maxlength="50" />
                </div>

                <div class="cd-form-grid">
                    <div class="cd-form-field">
                        <label class="cd-form-label" for="cd-cy-start">תאריך התחלה</label>
                        <input id="cd-cy-start" type="date" class="cd-form-input"
                               @bind="_cyStart" @bind:format="yyyy-MM-dd" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="cd-form-field">
                        <label class="cd-form-label" for="cd-cy-end">תאריך סיום</label>
                        <input id="cd-cy-end" type="date" class="cd-form-input"
                               @bind="_cyEnd" @bind:format="yyyy-MM-dd" />
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="cd-switch-row">
                    <div class="cd-switch-copy">
                        <span class="cd-switch-title">מחזור נוכחי</span>
                        <span class="cd-switch-note">המחזור המוצג כברירת מחדל במערכת</span>
                    </div>
                    <MToggle Checked="_cyCurrent"
                             CheckedChanged="@(v => _cyCurrent = v)"
                             Disabled="@CycleLocked"
                             AriaLabel="מחזור נוכחי" />
                </div>

                <div class="cd-switch-row">
                    <div class="cd-switch-copy">
                        <span class="cd-switch-title">מחזור פעיל</span>
                        <span class="cd-switch-note">מחזור לא פעיל נשמר במערכת אך אינו זמין לשיבוץ</span>
                    </div>
                    <MToggle Checked="_cyActive"
                             CheckedChanged="@(v => _cyActive = v)"
                             Disabled="@CycleLocked"
                             AriaLabel="מחזור פעיל" />
                </div>

                @* The server clears IsCurrent on every other cycle before
                   setting it here — the single-current rule is enforced there,
                   not by this form. The admin is told, not asked. *@
                @if (_cyCurrent && _cycle is not null && !_cycle.IsCurrent)
                {
                    <div class="cd-form-note">כל שאר המחזורים יוגדרו כ"לא נוכחי"</div>
                }

                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_cyError))
                {
                    <div class="cd-form-error" role="alert">@_cyError</div>
                }
            </div>

            <div class="cd-modal-footer">
                <div class="cd-footer-actions cd-footer-actions--only">
                    <button type="button" class="cd-btn-ghost" @onclick="CloseCycleModal" disabled="@_cySaving">ביטול</button>
                    <button type="button" class="cd-btn-primary motiva-cta" @onclick="SaveCycle" disabled="@_cySaving">
                        @if (_cySaving) { <span class="cd-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span> }
                        שמירה
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     APPLY TEMPLATES — library → this cycle's program
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ *@
@if (_tplOpen)
{
    <div class="cd-modal-overlay" @onclick="CloseTemplatesModal">
        <div class="cd-modal-box cd-modal-box--lg" @onclick:stopPropagation="true" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
            <div class="cd-modal-header">
                <span class="cd-modal-glyph" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" />
                        <rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" />
                        <rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" />
                        <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <div class="cd-modal-titles">
                    <div class="cd-modal-title">החלת תבניות</div>
                    <div class="cd-modal-subtitle">הוספת אבני דרך מספריית התבניות למחזור @(_cycle?.Name ?? "")</div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="cd-modal-close" @onclick="CloseTemplatesModal" aria-label="סגירה">
                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="cd-modal-body">
                @if (_tplLoading)
                {
                    <div class="cd-inline-state">
                        <span class="cd-spinner cd-spinner--ink" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        טוען תבניות…
                    </div>
                }
                else if (_templates.Count == 0)
                {
                    @* Not an error: it means the cycle already holds every
                       active template in the library. *@
                    <MEmptyState Title="אין תבניות להוספה"
                                 Description="כל התבניות הפעילות בספרייה כבר נמצאות בתוכנית המחזור"
                                 Live="true" />
                }
                else
                {
                    <p class="cd-modal-text">
                        בחרו את התבניות שיתווספו לתוכנית המחזור. התאריכים והסטטוס יילקחו מברירות המחדל של
                        כל תבנית וניתן לערוך אותם לאחר מכן — ההוספה אינה משנה את התבנית עצמה.
                    </p>

                    <div class="cd-tpl-list">
                        @foreach (var t in _templates)
                        {
                            var id = t.Id;
                            var picked = _tplPicked.Contains(id);
                            <button type="button"
                                    class="cd-tpl-row @(picked ? "cd-tpl-row--on" : "")"
                                    @onclick="@(() => ToggleTemplate(id))"
                                    aria-pressed="@(picked ? "true" : "false")">
                                <span class="cd-tpl-check @(picked ? "cd-tpl-check--on" : "")" aria-hidden="true">
                                    @if (picked)
                                    {
                                        <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                             stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                            <path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" />
                                        </svg>
                                    }
                                </span>
                                <span class="cd-tpl-copy">
                                    <span class="cd-tpl-title">@t.Title</span>
                                    @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(t.Description))
                                    {
                                        <span class="cd-tpl-desc">@t.Description</span>
                                    }
                                </span>
                                <span class="cd-type cd-type--@ToneFor(t.ProjectTypeId)">
                                    <span class="cd-type-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>@t.Applicability
                                </span>
                                <span class="cd-tpl-tasks">@t.TaskTemplateCount משימות</span>
                            </button>
                        }
                    </div>
                }

                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_tplError))
                {
                    <div class="cd-form-error" role="alert">@_tplError</div>
                }

                @if (_tplResult is not null)
                {
                    <div class="cd-form-success">
                        נוספו @_tplResult.Added אבני דרך לתוכנית המחזור@(_tplResult.Skipped > 0 ? $" · {_tplResult.Skipped} כבר היו קיימות" : "").
                    </div>
                }
            </div>

            <div class="cd-modal-footer">
                <span class="cd-footer-note">
                    @(_tplPicked.Count > 0 ? $"נבחרו {_tplPicked.Count} תבניות" : "לא נבחרו תבניות")
                </span>
                <div class="cd-footer-actions">
                    <button type="button" class="cd-btn-ghost" @onclick="CloseTemplatesModal" disabled="@_tplSaving">סגירה</button>
                    <button type="button" class="cd-btn-primary motiva-cta"
                            @onclick="ApplyTemplatesToProgram"
                            disabled="@(_tplSaving || _tplPicked.Count == 0)">
                        @if (_tplSaving) { <span class="cd-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span> }
                        הוספה לתוכנית
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     ROLL OUT TO PROJECTS — the pre-existing apply-templates business action
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ *@
@if (_rolloutPhase != RolloutPhase.None)
{
    <div class="cd-modal-overlay" @onclick="@(() => { if (_rolloutPhase != RolloutPhase.Running) CloseRollout(); })">
        <div class="cd-modal-box cd-modal-box--sm" @onclick:stopPropagation="true" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
            <div class="cd-modal-header">
                <span class="cd-modal-glyph" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-2.6-6.4" /><path d="M21 3v6h-6" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <div class="cd-modal-titles">
                    <div class="cd-modal-title">החלה על פרויקטי המחזור</div>
                    <div class="cd-modal-subtitle">@(_cycle?.Name ?? "")</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="cd-modal-body">
                @if (_rolloutPhase == RolloutPhase.Confirm)
                {
                    <p class="cd-modal-text">
                        המערכת תיצור את אבני הדרך של תוכנית המחזור, ואת המשימות שלהן, בכל הפרויקטים
                        הפעילים של המחזור. פריטים קיימים יישמרו ולא ייכפלו — הפעולה בטוחה לביצוע חוזר.
                    </p>
                }
                else if (_rolloutPhase == RolloutPhase.Running)
                {
                    <div class="cd-inline-state">
                        <span class="cd-spinner cd-spinner--ink" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        מחיל את התוכנית על פרויקטי המחזור…
                    </div>
                }
                else if (_rolloutPhase == RolloutPhase.Result && _rolloutResult is not null)
                {
                    <p class="cd-modal-text">סיכום הפעולה:</p>
                    <div class="cd-stat-grid">
                        <div class="cd-stat">
                            <span class="cd-stat-value">@_rolloutResult.ProjectsProcessed</span>
                            <span class="cd-stat-label">פרויקטים עובדו</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="cd-stat">
                            <span class="cd-stat-value">@_rolloutResult.MilestonesCreated</span>
                            <span class="cd-stat-label">אבני דרך נוצרו</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="cd-stat">
                            <span class="cd-stat-value">@_rolloutResult.TasksCreated</span>
                            <span class="cd-stat-label">משימות נוצרו</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="cd-stat cd-stat--quiet">
                            <span class="cd-stat-value">@_rolloutResult.MilestonesSkipped</span>
                            <span class="cd-stat-label">אבני דרך קיימות</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="cd-stat cd-stat--quiet">
                            <span class="cd-stat-value">@_rolloutResult.TasksSkipped</span>
                            <span class="cd-stat-label">משימות קיימות</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }
                else if (_rolloutPhase == RolloutPhase.Error)
                {
                    <div class="cd-form-error" role="alert">@_rolloutError</div>
                }
            </div>

            <div class="cd-modal-footer">
                <div class="cd-footer-actions cd-footer-actions--only">
                    @if (_rolloutPhase == RolloutPhase.Confirm)
                    {
                        <button type="button" class="cd-btn-ghost" @onclick="CloseRollout">ביטול</button>
                        <button type="button" class="cd-btn-primary motiva-cta" @onclick="ExecuteRollout">בצע החלה</button>
                    }
                    else if (_rolloutPhase == RolloutPhase.Error)
                    {
                        <button type="button" class="cd-btn-ghost" @onclick="CloseRollout">סגירה</button>
                        <button type="button" class="cd-btn-primary motiva-cta" @onclick="ExecuteRollout">נסו שנית</button>
                    }
                    else if (_rolloutPhase == RolloutPhase.Result)
                    {
                        <button type="button" class="cd-btn-primary motiva-cta" @onclick="CloseRollout">סגירה</button>
                    }
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@* Removal. The server refuses once projects hold the milestone, so the
   dialog states the count up front and the confirm carries the rose fill. *@
<MConfirmDialog IsOpen="_deleteOpen"
                Title="הסרת אבן דרך מהמחזור"
                Tone="MConfirmDialog.ConfirmTone.Danger"
                ConfirmText="הסרה מהמחזור"
                Busy="_deleteBusy"
                Error="@_deleteError"
                OnConfirm="ExecuteDelete"
                OnCancel="@(() => { if (!_deleteBusy) { _deleteOpen = false; _deleteError = null; } })">
    @if (_deleteTarget is not null)
    {
        @if (_deleteTarget.ProjectCount > 0)
        {
            <span>
                אבן הדרך <strong>@_deleteTarget.Title</strong> משויכת כבר
                <strong>@_deleteTarget.ProjectCount</strong> פרויקטים במחזור, ולכן לא ניתן להסיר אותה —
                ההסרה הייתה מוחקת את ההתקדמות שנרשמה בהם. ניתן להשבית אותה במקום זאת.
            </span>
        }
        else
        {
            <span>
                להסיר את <strong>@_deleteTarget.Title</strong> מתוכנית המחזור?
                התבנית עצמה תישמר בספריית התבניות וניתן יהיה להוסיף אותה שוב.
            </span>
        }
    }
</MConfirmDialog>

<div class="cd-page" dir="rtl" @onclick="CloseAllMenus">

    @* ══ Header ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ *@
    <header class="cd-head">
        <div class="cd-head-main">
            <MAdminBack Href="management/cycles" Label="מחזורים אקדמיים" />

            <div class="cd-head-line">
                <h1 class="cd-h1">@(_cycle is null ? "מחזור" : $"מחזור {_cycle.Name}")</h1>

                @if (_cycle is not null)
                {
                    @if (_cycle.IsCurrent)
                    {
                        <span class="cd-state-tag">
                            <span class="cd-state-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>נוכחי
                        </span>
                    }

                    @* Only the non-default lifecycle states are surfaced. A
                       plain active, non-current cycle needs no badge — the
                       absence of one already says it. *@
                    @if (_cycle.Status is "Closed" or "Archived" or "Inactive")
                    {
                        <span class="cd-status cd-status--@_cycle.Status.ToLowerInvariant()">
                            <span class="cd-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>@StatusLabel(_cycle.Status)
                        </span>
                    }

                    <p class="cd-meta">@MetaLine</p>
                }
            </div>
        </div>

        @if (_cycle is not null)
        {
            <div class="cd-head-actions" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
                <button type="button" class="cd-btn-secondary" @onclick="OpenCycleModal">
                    <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M17 3a2.8 2.8 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5Z" />
                    </svg>
                    עריכת מחזור
                </button>
            </div>
        }
    </header>

    @if (_loadError)
    {
        <MEmptyState Title="שגיאה בטעינת המחזור"
                     Description="ייתכן שהמחזור נמחק או שאין חיבור לשרת. חזרו לרשימת המחזורים ונסו שנית."
                     Live="true" />
    }
    else
    {
        @* ══ Program section head ═════════════════════════════════════════ *@
        <div class="cd-section-head" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
            <p class="cd-section-title">
                תוכנית המחזור
                @if (!_loading)
                {
                    <span class="cd-section-note">@ProgramLine</span>
                }
            </p>

            <div class="cd-section-actions">
                <button type="button" class="cd-btn-primary motiva-cta"
                        @onclick="OpenNewMilestone" disabled="@CycleLocked">
                    <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                    </svg>
                    אבן דרך
                </button>

                <div class="cd-actions">
                    <button type="button"
                            class="cd-round-btn @(_programMenuOpen ? "cd-round-btn--on" : "")"
                            @onclick="ToggleProgramMenu"
                            aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="@(_programMenuOpen ? "true" : "false")"
                            title="פעולות נוספות" aria-label="פעולות נוספות על תוכנית המחזור">
                        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="1.7" />
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.7" />
                            <circle cx="12" cy="19" r="1.7" />
                        </svg>
                    </button>

                    @if (_programMenuOpen)
                    {
                        <div class="cd-menu cd-menu--program" role="menu">
                            <button type="button" class="cd-menu-item cd-menu-item--rich" role="menuitem"
                                    @onclick="OpenTemplatesModal" disabled="@CycleLocked">
                                <span class="cd-menu-ico" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                         stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                        <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" />
                                        <rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" />
                                        <rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" />
                                        <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" />
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                                <span class="cd-menu-copy">
                                    <span class="cd-menu-title">החלת תבניות</span>
                                    <span class="cd-menu-note">הוספת אבני דרך מספריית התבניות למחזור זה</span>
                                </span>
                            </button>

                            <button type="button" class="cd-menu-item cd-menu-item--rich" role="menuitem"
                                    @onclick="OpenRollout" disabled="@(CycleLocked || _program.Count == 0)">
                                <span class="cd-menu-ico" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                         stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                        <path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-2.6-6.4" /><path d="M21 3v6h-6" />
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                                <span class="cd-menu-copy">
                                    <span class="cd-menu-title">החלה על פרויקטי המחזור</span>
                                    <span class="cd-menu-note">יצירת אבני הדרך והמשימות בכל הפרויקטים הפעילים</span>
                                </span>
                            </button>

                            <div class="cd-menu-sep"></div>

                            <button type="button" class="cd-menu-item" role="menuitem"
                                    @onclick="@(() => Nav.NavigateTo($"management/cycles/{CycleId}/stages"))">
                                <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                     stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <path d="M3 3v18h18" /><path d="m7 14 3-3 3 3 5-5" />
                                </svg>
                                ניהול שלבי תוכנית
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    }
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        @if (CycleLocked)
        {
            <div class="cd-locked-note">
                תוכנית המחזור נעולה לעריכה — המחזור @(_cycle?.Status == "Archived" ? "בארכיון" : "סגור").
            </div>
        }

        @* ══ The program table ════════════════════════════════════════════ *@
        <MDataTable TItem="CycleMilestoneDto"
                    Items="_program"
                    Loading="_loading"
                    LoadingText="טוען את תוכנית המחזור…"
                    ColumnCount="9"
                    MinWidth="1040px"
                    Class="cd-table">

            <Columns>
                <col class="cd-col-num" />
                <col />
                <col class="cd-col-type" />
                <col class="cd-col-dates" />
                <col class="cd-col-count" />
                <col class="cd-col-count" />
                <col class="cd-col-status" />
                <col class="cd-col-order" />
                <col class="cd-col-actions" />
            </Columns>

            <HeaderContent>
                <th scope="col"><span class="cd-sr">מספר סידורי</span></th>
                <th scope="col">אבן דרך</th>
                <th scope="col">רלוונטי ל־</th>
                <th scope="col">תאריכים במחזור</th>
                <th scope="col">משימות</th>
                <th scope="col">פרויקטים</th>
                <th scope="col">סטטוס</th>
                <th scope="col">סדר</th>
                <th scope="col"><span class="cd-sr">פעולות</span></th>
            </HeaderContent>

            <EmptyContent>
                <MEmptyState Title="אין אבני דרך במחזור זה"
                             Description="החילו תבניות מהספרייה או הוסיפו אבן דרך ידנית"
                             Live="true" />
            </EmptyContent>

            <RowTemplate Context="m">
                @{
                    var index    = _program.IndexOf(m);
                    var menuOpen = _openRowMenuId == m.Id;
                    var first    = index == 0;
                    var last     = index == _program.Count - 1;
                }
                <tr class="@(menuOpen ? "m-dt-row-active" : "") @(m.IsActive ? "" : "cd-row--off")">

                    <td>
                        <span class="cd-num" aria-hidden="true">@((index + 1).ToString("00"))</span>
                    </td>

                    <td class="cd-cell-name">
                        <span class="cd-name-line">
                            <span class="cd-name" title="@m.Title">@m.Title</span>
                            @if (m.TemplateCycleUsage > 1)
                            {
                                <span class="cd-shared" title="התבנית משמשת יותר ממחזור אחד">
                                    <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                         stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <rect x="9" y="9" width="12" height="12" rx="2" />
                                        <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1" />
                                    </svg>
                                    תבנית משותפת
                                </span>
                            }
                        </span>
                        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(m.Description))
                        {
                            <span class="cd-desc" title="@m.Description">@m.Description</span>
                        }
                    </td>

                    <td>
                        <span class="cd-type cd-type--@ToneFor(m.ProjectTypeId)">
                            <span class="cd-type-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>@m.Applicability
                        </span>
                    </td>

                    <td class="cd-cell-dates @(HasDates(m) ? "" : "cd-cell-empty")">@DateRange(m)</td>

                    <td class="cd-cell-num">@m.TaskTemplateCount</td>

                    <td class="cd-cell-num @(m.ProjectCount == 0 ? "cd-cell-empty" : "")">
                        @(m.ProjectCount == 0 ? "—" : m.ProjectCount.ToString())
                    </td>

                    <td>
                        <span class="cd-status @(m.IsActive ? "cd-status--on" : "cd-status--off")">
                            <span class="cd-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            @(m.IsActive ? "פעיל" : "לא פעיל")
                        </span>
                    </td>

                    <td @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
                        <span class="cd-order">
                            <button type="button" class="cd-order-btn"
                                    @onclick="@(() => MoveMilestone(m, -1))"
                                    disabled="@(first || CycleLocked || _movingId == m.Id)"
                                    title="הזזה למעלה" aria-label="@($"הזזת {m.Title} למעלה")">
                                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                     stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6" />
                                </svg>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" class="cd-order-btn"
                                    @onclick="@(() => MoveMilestone(m, 1))"
                                    disabled="@(last || CycleLocked || _movingId == m.Id)"
                                    title="הזזה למטה" aria-label="@($"הזזת {m.Title} למטה")">
                                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                     stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" />
                                </svg>
                            </button>
                        </span>
                    </td>

                    <td class="cd-cell-actions" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
                        <div class="cd-actions">
                            <button type="button"
                                    class="cd-kebab @(menuOpen ? "cd-kebab--on" : "")"
                                    @onclick="@(() => ToggleRowMenu(m.Id))"
                                    disabled="@CycleLocked"
                                    aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="@(menuOpen ? "true" : "false")"
                                    title="פעולות" aria-label="@($"פעולות עבור {m.Title}")">
                                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="1.7" />
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.7" />
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="19" r="1.7" />
                                </svg>
                            </button>

                            @if (menuOpen)
                            {
                                <div class="cd-menu cd-menu--row" role="menu">
                                    <button type="button" class="cd-menu-item" role="menuitem"
                                            @onclick="@(() => OpenEditMilestone(m))">
                                        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                             stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                            <path d="M17 3a2.8 2.8 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5Z" />
                                        </svg>
                                        עריכת אבן דרך
                                    </button>

                                    <button type="button" class="cd-menu-item" role="menuitem"
                                            @onclick="@(() => ToggleMilestoneActive(m))">
                                        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                             stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
                                            @if (m.IsActive)
                                            {
                                                <path d="M5.6 5.6 18.4 18.4" />
                                            }
                                            else
                                            {
                                                <path d="m8.5 12.2 2.4 2.4 4.6-4.9" />
                                            }
                                        </svg>
                                        @(m.IsActive ? "השבתה במחזור" : "הפעלה במחזור")
                                    </button>

                                    <div class="cd-menu-sep"></div>

                                    <button type="button" class="cd-menu-item cd-menu-item--danger" role="menuitem"
                                            @onclick="@(() => RequestDelete(m))">
                                        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                             stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                            <path d="M3 6h18" />
                                            <path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6" />
                                            <path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2" />
                                        </svg>
                                        הסרה מהמחזור
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            }
                        </div>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </RowTemplate>
        </MDataTable>
    }
</div>

@code {

    [Parameter] public int CycleId { get; set; }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Data
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private AcademicYearDto?       _cycle;
    private List<CycleMilestoneDto> _program = new();
    private bool _loading   = true;
    private bool _loadError = false;

    /// <summary>Closed and Archived cycles are immutable server-side. Every
    /// write control on this page is disabled rather than left to fail on
    /// submit — the same guard ManagementController and the program endpoints
    /// enforce, surfaced before the click instead of after it.</summary>
    private bool CycleLocked => _cycle?.Status is "Closed" or "Archived";

    protected override async Task OnParametersSetAsync()
    {
        _loading = true;
        await ReloadAsync();
        _loading = false;
    }

    private async Task ReloadAsync()
    {
        _cycle = await ManagementService.GetAcademicYearAsync(CycleId);

        if (_cycle is null) { _loadError = true; _program = new(); return; }

        _loadError = false;

        // The server returns the program already sorted; the list is rendered
        // in the order it arrives and never re-sorted here, so the "#" column
        // and the up/down arrows always agree with what the server will do.
        _program = await ManagementService.GetCycleProgramAsync(CycleId) ?? new();
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Header / section copy
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private string MetaLine
    {
        get
        {
            if (_cycle is null) return "";

            var dates = $"{_cycle.StartDate:dd.MM.yyyy} – {_cycle.EndDate:dd.MM.yyyy}";
            return _cycle.ProjectCount > 0 ? $"{dates} · {_cycle.ProjectCount} פרויקטים" : dates;
        }
    }

    private string ProgramLine
    {
        get
        {
            if (_program.Count == 0) return "אין אבני דרך";
            int active = _program.Count(m => m.IsActive);
            return $"{_program.Count} אבני דרך · {active} פעילות";
        }
    }

    private static string StatusLabel(string status) => status switch
    {
        "Active"   => "פעיל",
        "Inactive" => "לא פעיל",
        "Closed"   => "סגור",
        "Archived" => "בארכיון",
        _          => status,
    };

    /// <summary>Colour role for a project-type chip. Categorical, not semantic:
    /// a project type means neither progress nor attention, so these are the
    /// brand hues at low alpha and rose is not used at all.</summary>
    private static string ToneFor(int? projectTypeId) => projectTypeId switch
    {
        1 => "tech",
        2 => "method",
        _ => "both",
    };

    private record TypeChoice(int? Value, string Label, string Tone);

    /// <summary>The three values ProjectTypeId can hold. Not a lookup from the
    /// server: ProjectTypes has exactly these two rows plus the NULL "both"
    /// case, and MilestoneTemplatesController resolves the same three labels.</summary>
    private static readonly TypeChoice[] TypeChoices =
    {
        new(1,    "טכנולוגי",   "tech"),
        new(2,    "מתודולוגי",  "method"),
        new(null, "שניהם",      "both"),
    };

    private static bool HasDates(CycleMilestoneDto m) => m.OpenDate is not null || m.DueDate is not null;

    /// <summary>"01.10.25 – 15.10.25", or one endpoint, or an em dash. Two-digit
    /// years: the column is 138px in the reference and a full year on both ends
    /// wraps.</summary>
    private static string DateRange(CycleMilestoneDto m)
    {
        string? open = m.OpenDate?.ToString("dd.MM.yy");
        string? due  = m.DueDate?.ToString("dd.MM.yy");

        if (open is not null && due is not null) return $"{open} – {due}";
        if (due  is not null)                    return $"עד {due}";
        if (open is not null)                    return $"מ־{open}";
        return "—";
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Menus
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private int  _openRowMenuId    = -1;
    private bool _programMenuOpen  = false;

    private void ToggleRowMenu(int id)
    {
        _openRowMenuId   = _openRowMenuId == id ? -1 : id;
        _programMenuOpen = false;
    }

    private void ToggleProgramMenu()
    {
        _programMenuOpen = !_programMenuOpen;
        _openRowMenuId   = -1;
    }

    private void CloseAllMenus()
    {
        _openRowMenuId   = -1;
        _programMenuOpen = false;
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Ordering
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private int _movingId = -1;

    /// <summary>
    /// One step up or down. The list is re-read from the server afterwards
    /// rather than swapped locally: the move endpoint normalises DisplayOrder
    /// across the whole cycle, so the authoritative order is the one it
    /// returns, not the one this page guessed.
    /// </summary>
    private async Task MoveMilestone(CycleMilestoneDto m, int direction)
    {
        if (CycleLocked || _movingId != -1) return;

        _movingId = m.Id;
        bool ok = await ManagementService.MoveCycleMilestoneAsync(CycleId, m.Id, direction);
        if (ok) _program = await ManagementService.GetCycleProgramAsync(CycleId) ?? _program;
        _movingId = -1;
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Milestone modal
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private bool      _msOpen;
    private bool      _msSaving;
    private int       _msEditId;          // 0 = create
    private string    _msName        = "";
    private string    _msDescription = "";
    private int?      _msProjectTypeId;
    private bool      _msRequired    = true;
    private bool      _msActive      = true;
    private DateTime? _msOpenDate;
    private DateTime? _msDueDate;
    private int       _msSharedCycles;
    private string    _msOrderLabel  = "";
    private string    _msError       = "";

    private void OpenNewMilestone()
    {
        if (CycleLocked) return;
        CloseAllMenus();

        _msEditId        = 0;
        _msName          = "";
        _msDescription   = "";
        _msProjectTypeId = null;
        _msRequired      = true;
        _msActive        = true;
        _msOpenDate      = null;
        _msDueDate       = null;
        _msSharedCycles  = 0;
        _msOrderLabel    = "";
        _msError         = "";
        _msOpen          = true;
    }

    private void OpenEditMilestone(CycleMilestoneDto m)
    {
        CloseAllMenus();

        _msEditId        = m.Id;
        _msName          = m.Title;
        _msDescription   = m.Description ?? "";
        _msProjectTypeId = m.ProjectTypeId;
        _msRequired      = m.IsRequired;
        _msActive        = m.IsActive;
        _msOpenDate      = m.OpenDate;
        _msDueDate       = m.DueDate;
        _msSharedCycles  = m.TemplateCycleUsage;
        _msOrderLabel    = (_program.IndexOf(m) + 1).ToString("00");
        _msError         = "";
        _msOpen          = true;
    }

    private void CloseMilestoneModal()
    {
        if (_msSaving) return;
        _msOpen  = false;
        _msError = "";
    }

    private async Task SaveMilestone()
    {
        _msError = "";

        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_msName)) { _msError = "שם אבן הדרך הוא שדה חובה"; return; }

        if (_msOpenDate is not null && _msDueDate is not null && _msDueDate < _msOpenDate)
        {
            _msError = "תאריך היעד חייב להיות אחרי תאריך ההתחלה";
            return;
        }

        _msSaving = true;

        var req = new SaveCycleMilestoneRequest
        {
            Title         = _msName.Trim(),
            Description   = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_msDescription) ? null : _msDescription.Trim(),
            IsRequired    = _msRequired,
            ProjectTypeId = _msProjectTypeId,
            OpenDate      = _msOpenDate,
            DueDate       = _msDueDate,
            IsActive      = _msActive,
        };

        var (ok, error) = _msEditId == 0
            ? await ManagementService.CreateCycleMilestoneAsync(CycleId, req)
            : await ManagementService.UpdateCycleMilestoneAsync(CycleId, _msEditId, req);

        _msSaving = false;

        if (!ok) { _msError = error ?? "שגיאה בשמירה. נסו שנית."; return; }

        _msOpen = false;
        await ReloadAsync();
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Per-cycle activation
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private async Task ToggleMilestoneActive(CycleMilestoneDto m)
    {
        CloseAllMenus();

        if (await ManagementService.ToggleCycleMilestoneActiveAsync(CycleId, m.Id))
            m.IsActive = !m.IsActive;
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Removal from the cycle
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private bool                _deleteOpen;
    private bool                _deleteBusy;
    private string?             _deleteError;
    private CycleMilestoneDto?  _deleteTarget;

    private void RequestDelete(CycleMilestoneDto m)
    {
        CloseAllMenus();
        _deleteTarget = m;
        _deleteError  = null;
        _deleteOpen   = true;
    }

    private async Task ExecuteDelete()
    {
        if (_deleteTarget is null) return;

        _deleteBusy  = true;
        _deleteError = null;

        var (ok, error) = await ManagementService.DeleteCycleMilestoneAsync(CycleId, _deleteTarget.Id);

        _deleteBusy = false;

        if (!ok)
        {
            // The server's own sentence, not a generic failure: it names the
            // number of projects holding the milestone and the alternative.
            _deleteError = error ?? "ההסרה נכשלה. נסו שנית.";
            return;
        }

        _deleteOpen   = false;
        _deleteTarget = null;
        await ReloadAsync();
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Edit cycle modal
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private bool     _cyOpen;
    private bool     _cySaving;
    private string   _cyName    = "";
    private DateTime _cyStart   = DateTime.Today;
    private DateTime _cyEnd     = DateTime.Today;
    private bool     _cyCurrent;
    private bool     _cyActive  = true;
    private string   _cyError   = "";

    private void OpenCycleModal()
    {
        if (_cycle is null) return;
        CloseAllMenus();

        _cyName    = _cycle.Name;
        _cyStart   = _cycle.StartDate;
        _cyEnd     = _cycle.EndDate;
        _cyCurrent = _cycle.IsCurrent;
        _cyActive  = _cycle.IsActive;
        _cyError   = "";
        _cyOpen    = true;
    }

    private void CloseCycleModal()
    {
        if (_cySaving) return;
        _cyOpen  = false;
        _cyError = "";
    }

    private async Task SaveCycle()
    {
        _cyError = "";

        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_cyName)) { _cyError = "שם המחזור הוא שדה חובה"; return; }
        if (_cyEnd <= _cyStart)                 { _cyError = "תאריך סיום חייב להיות אחרי תאריך ההתחלה"; return; }

        _cySaving = true;

        bool ok = await ManagementService.UpdateAcademicYearAsync(CycleId, new SaveAcademicYearRequest
        {
            Name      = _cyName.Trim(),
            StartDate = _cyStart,
            EndDate   = _cyEnd,
            IsActive  = _cyActive,
            IsCurrent = _cyCurrent,
        });

        _cySaving = false;

        if (!ok) { _cyError = "שגיאה בשמירה. נסו שנית."; return; }

        _cyOpen = false;
        await ReloadAsync();
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Apply templates — library → this cycle's program
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private bool _tplOpen;
    private bool _tplLoading;
    private bool _tplSaving;
    private List<AvailableMilestoneTemplateDto> _templates = new();
    private HashSet<int> _tplPicked = new();
    private ApplyMilestoneTemplatesResultDto? _tplResult;
    private string _tplError = "";

    private async Task OpenTemplatesModal()
    {
        if (CycleLocked) return;
        CloseAllMenus();

        _tplOpen    = true;
        _tplLoading = true;
        _tplPicked  = new();
        _tplResult  = null;
        _tplError   = "";

        _templates  = await ManagementService.GetAvailableMilestoneTemplatesAsync(CycleId) ?? new();
        _tplLoading = false;
    }

    private void CloseTemplatesModal()
    {
        if (_tplSaving) return;
        _tplOpen = false;
    }

    private void ToggleTemplate(int id)
    {
        if (!_tplPicked.Add(id)) _tplPicked.Remove(id);
        _tplResult = null;
    }

    private async Task ApplyTemplatesToProgram()
    {
        if (_tplPicked.Count == 0) return;

        _tplSaving = true;
        _tplError  = "";
        _tplResult = null;

        var result = await ManagementService.ApplyMilestoneTemplatesAsync(CycleId, _tplPicked.ToList());

        _tplSaving = false;

        if (result is null) { _tplError = "שגיאה בהחלת התבניות. נסו שנית."; return; }

        _tplResult = result;
        _tplPicked = new();

        // Both lists change: the program grew, and the templates just applied
        // are no longer available to apply again.
        await ReloadAsync();
        _templates = await ManagementService.GetAvailableMilestoneTemplatesAsync(CycleId) ?? new();
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Roll out to projects — the pre-existing business action
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private enum RolloutPhase { None, Confirm, Running, Result, Error }

    private RolloutPhase             _rolloutPhase = RolloutPhase.None;
    private ApplyTemplatesResultDto? _rolloutResult;
    private string                   _rolloutError = "";

    private void OpenRollout()
    {
        if (CycleLocked || _program.Count == 0) return;
        CloseAllMenus();

        _rolloutResult = null;
        _rolloutError  = "";
        _rolloutPhase  = RolloutPhase.Confirm;
    }

    private async Task ExecuteRollout()
    {
        _rolloutPhase = RolloutPhase.Running;

        var result = await ManagementService.ApplyTemplatesAsync(CycleId);

        if (result is null)
        {
            _rolloutError = "שגיאה בהחלת התוכנית. בדקו את החיבור לשרת ונסו שנית.";
            _rolloutPhase = RolloutPhase.Error;
            return;
        }

        _rolloutResult = result;
        _rolloutPhase  = RolloutPhase.Result;

        // The rollout creates ProjectMilestones, which is exactly what the
        // פרויקטים column counts.
        await ReloadAsync();
    }

    private void CloseRollout() => _rolloutPhase = RolloutPhase.None;
}
